		],
		tags: ["WeOwnNet Founder", "#FedArch Author", "REtoken Co-Founder"],
	},
	{
		initials: "NC",
		handle: "@CTO 🏛️",
		name: "Nik Cimino",
		role: "Chief Technology Officer",
		bio: [
			"An electrical engineer by training and a software engineer by practice, I bring more than twenty years of experience across the high-tech sector. My career began at Xilinx (now AMD), where I contributed to the Hardware Accelerator SDK, FPGA Editor, and core internal frameworks.",
			"In the years since, my work has centered on blockchain and decentralized systems: smart wallets, Web3 analytics platforms, governance and voting contracts, decentralized exchanges, NFT and token systems, and DAO tooling — alongside more specialized efforts including a password-based private-key derivation algorithm, a domain-specific language for generating user interfaces directly from smart contracts, and the release of an EVM-based blockchain as a testnet. Throughout this period, I served as CTO and Fractional CTO to several Web3 technology companies.",
			"Today I am the founder of Perpetuator LLC, an agentic AI company delivering consulting services and a growing product portfolio, including CapitalCopilot.io.",
		],
		tags: ["Xilinx / AMD Alum", "Web3 & DAO Tooling", "Perpetuator LLC Founder"],
	},
	{
		initials: "DM",
		handle: "@PLT 🛠️",
		name: "Dilonne Muchingami",
		role: "Platform Engineer",
		bio: [
			"I studied software engineering. I’ve got 8 years of experience across fintech, AI/ML, Web3/DeFi, and platform infrastructure. I got into machine learning before the LLM boom, delivering an MLaaS platform and was core to a project that curbed the spread of COVID-19 at Kenyatta National Hospital, one of Africa's largest, where we used IoT + on-edge AI for people-count and face-mask detection to enforce compliance.",
			"Huge fan of emerging technologies, I love continuously discovering better ways of doing things and AI has opened up so many opportunities. My goal through AI Directed engineering is to help others do more with AI by building the resilient, highly-available systems that quietly power the digital world we all love.",
		],
		tags: ["MLaaS Platforms", "AI-Directed Engineering", "Fintech & Web3"],
	},
	{
		initials: "MK",
		handle: "@MWK 💻",
		name: "Mohammed Waseem Khan",
		role: "Platform Engineer, MS in Computer Science, Westcliff University",
		bio: [
			"I'm the one keeping the lights on deploying the infrastructure, managing the servers, and making sure everything from the website to the community platform runs smoothly. My stack includes Kubernetes, Docker, Cloudflare Workers, GitHub Actions, and a lot of terminal windows.",
